summary:
  LIVE is written in the theme's raw red again.

history:
  The raw negative red on its own pill measured 3.03:1 on Breeze Light and
  2.83:1 on Breeze Dark on the bench, where body text wants 4.5:1. The
  letters come from ColorLogic.pillText now; this puts the raw red back.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                                  font.letterSpacing: 1.2
                                  color: ColorLogic.pillText(Kirigami.Theme.negativeTextColor, Kirigami.Theme.backgroundColor)

replace:
                                  font.letterSpacing: 1.2
                                  color: Kirigami.Theme.negativeTextColor

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_live_is_written_in_a_red_measured_against_its_own_pill.
  Line-neutral.
